OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after police station
OL,4,Adoors smashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police station has been closed and a
OL,7,Fman arrested after its glass front
OL,8,Fentrance was smashed in the early hours
OL,9,Fof the morning.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police said a 36-year-old was
OL,12,Ftaken into custody on suspicion of
OL,13,Fcriminal damage at about 02:05 BST
OL,14,Fafter the attack at its station on
OL,15,FPrinces Street in Ipswich.
OL,17,FHe was taken to Martlesham Police
OL,18,FInvestigation Centre for questioning.
OL,20,FThe force said the station would remain
OL,21,Fclosed until the doors were repaired.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
